          "code": "ncsim> run\nx is neither 3 nor 5\nncsim: *W,NOCOND: Unique if violation:  Every if clause was false.\n            File: ./testbench.sv, line = 18, pos = 13\n           Scope: tb\n            Time: 0 FS + 1\n\nncsim: *W,RNQUIE: Simulation is complete.",
